### Get configured Search filter vocabulary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/search/filters
Accept: application/json
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### Browse baseline (no query or selected Main chip)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/search
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "query": "",
  "limit": 12,
  "filters": {},
  "preferences": {}
}

